      <title>The Betting Coup That Rocked London’s Bookmakers Goes Unsolved</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-31/the-betting-coup-that-rocked-london-s-bookmakers-goes-unsolved</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">84c1433feaff1e07a8046720</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 08:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Lisa Lazarus, the top cop in US horse racing, woke up one morning this summer to find a flurry of missed overseas calls and e-mails. They were all from UK regulators and they all delivered the same urgent message: a series of large, unusual and suspiciously successful wagers on US races had been placed in London the day before, saddling some of the city’s famed betting parlors with hefty losses, and they needed her help.</description>
